  "changes": [
    "kqs_runtime.pullback_v4: Daily Trend Pullback v4 ported from the archived strategy_validation_v4.py (8e4dc15f3f135f5b) / data_loader.py (ff1f239c95de9c24); rules, parameters, ranking weights and day loop unchanged",
